  "description": "Afnan 9PM Night Out Extrait de Parfum is a powerful, high-concentration version crafted specifically for nightlife, confidence, and attention. This extrait intensifies the signature sweet amber-vanilla DNA with deeper warmth and stronger projection. The opening delivers a bold burst of fruity freshness and spice, immediately energetic and attention-grabbing. The heart develops into smooth lavender and sweet aromatic tones that add structure and masculine depth. The base settles into rich vanilla, warm amber, and sensual woods, creating an ultra-long-lasting, addictive trail that dominates the evening. 9PM Night Out Extrait is designed for men who want strong performance, sweetness with depth, and a fragrance that commands presence after dark.",
